  "Restoring changes which servers Rivulet searches — a backup carries its own source list, and it wins.": "Restaurar muda quais servidores o Rivulet consulta — um backup traz a sua própria lista de fontes, e ela vence.",
  "Restrict content by age rating. A PIN prevents changes without authorization.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Restrict content by age rating. A PIN prevents changes without authorization.",
